</div></section>
<h2 class="ed-section-heading" id="section-1"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span>Work from the agreed list</h2>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Use the essentials you identified in the <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="/guides/new-windows-computer-move-checklist/">move preparation checklist</a>. Check together where possible, with the customer entering their own passwords and authentication codes.</p>
